    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Saif, <div><br></div><div>I think there are two issues. </div><div><br></div><div>1. you&#39;re specifying the width of the bars at 0.2, this will make your bars 20% of the width of the space. This makes them nice and narrow like you have above.</div><div>2. The second issue is that your legend is super large because of the names. That is stretching the plot out to fit it on the same window.</div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s an example:</div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span></span>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">library(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">tidyverse</span>)</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160);min-height:27px\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><br></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(220,50,47)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">DF</span><span style=\"color:rgb(160,160,160)\"> &lt;- read.table(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">text</span><span style=\"color:rgb(160,160,160)\">=</span>&quot;Rank ReallySuperDuperlongname1 <span>    </span>ReallySuperDuperlongname2 <span>    </span>ReallySuperDuperlongname3</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(220,50,47)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">1<span>    </span>500<span>    </span>250<span>    </span>50</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(220,50,47)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">2<span>    </span>400<span>    </span>100<span>    </span>30</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(220,50,47)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">3<span>    </span>300<span>    </span>155<span>    </span>100</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(220,50,47)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\">4<span>    </span>200<span>    </span>90 <span>    </span>10&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(160,160,160)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">header</span><span style=\"color:rgb(160,160,160)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(195,136,6)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(160,160,160)\">)</span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160);min-height:27px\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160);min-height:27px\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"># this is close to what you have</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">DF</span> %&gt;%</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>gather(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">.</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">trait</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">value</span>, -<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">Rank</span>) %&gt;%</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ggplot(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">.</span>, aes(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">x</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">Rank</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">y</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">value</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">fill</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">trait</span>)) +</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>geom_bar(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">stat</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(220,50,47)\">&quot;identity&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">position</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(220,50,47)\">&quot;fill&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">width</span> = <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">0.2</span>) +</font></p></div></div>"
