     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>guides(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">color</span> = guide_legend(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">nrow </span>= <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">2</span>)) +</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>scale_x_discrete(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">expand</span> = c(<span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">0</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">0</span>))</font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160);min-height:27px\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160);min-height:27px\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"># if you change the width to 0.9 (the default) you get fat bars that fill the space<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:20px;line-height:normal;color:rgb(160,160,160)\"><font face=\"comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(38,139,210)\">DF</span>